        },
        {
            "+content": "Work can be murder. Kanako Nishino has finally had enough and quit her crummy advertising job, only for the first new application she puts in to turn out to be for a crew of hitmen. Even more surprising, Kanako's got a natural talent for the job and they'd love to have her. Satisfying employment can be hard to find, but Kanako has to wonder if it's worth taking when the actual job is so extreme. And that's to say nothing of how she feels as she comes to realize she might actually enjoy bumping people off than she previously expected. <em class=de-emphasized>(from manga)</em>",
            "+@type": "Plot Summary"
